---
import BlogPostLayout from "../../layouts/BlogPostLayout.astro";
import DetailInteractions from "../../components/DetailInteractions.astro";
import { withBase } from "../../utils/paths";
---

<BlogPostLayout
	title="如来者，即诸法如义。"
	description="不要把答案想得太远，它往往就在眼前这件事里。"
	keywords="金刚经,如来者,诸法如义,南怀瑾,读书感悟,阅读笔记"
	canonicalPath="/notes/jingangjing-0623/"
>
	<main class="reading-note">
		<section class="note-hero">
			<img src={withBase('/assets/cover/header-jingangjing-0610.png')} alt="金刚经的读后感悟" />
		</section>

		<article class="note-content">
			<a class="note-back" href={withBase('/')} aria-label="返回首页">
				<span>←</span>
				返回首页
			</a>
			<div class="note-meta">READING NOTE · 2026.06.23</div>
			<h1 class="font-huiwen">如来者，即诸法如义。</h1>
			<p class="lead">不要把“答案”想得太远，它往往就在眼前这件事里。</p>

			<p>南怀瑾讲“如来”，很妙：好像来了，其实没有一个固定的东西来；你说它没来，它又处处显现。所谓“诸法如义”，就是一切事情本身，都可以让你看见真实。</p>
			<p>这句话放到日常里，就是别总以为修行、成长、理解，一定在某个特别时刻才发生。不是非要进山、闭关、读到某句惊天动地的话，才叫有所得。一个人的脸色、一次误解、一次重复学习、一次边界感的建立，都可能是“法”。</p>
			<p>关键不在事情多高级，而在你有没有看见：我此刻住在哪里？住在委屈？住在证明？住在好人相？住在“我已经懂了”？</p>
			<p>如来不在远处，真实也不在概念里。它就在今天具体的人和事里，只是我们常常急着评判，没来得及照见。</p>

			<section class="note-reminder">
				<h2>今日小提醒</h2>
				<p>今天遇到一件小事时，先别急着处理情绪，问一句：这件事正在照出我什么执着？</p>
			</section>
		</article>
		<DetailInteractions
			articleSelector=".note-content"
			storageKey="jingangjing-0623-comments"
		/>
	</main>
</BlogPostLayout>

<style lang="scss">
	:global(.train-1) {
		display: none !important;
	}

	.reading-note {
		width: 100%;
		margin: 0 auto 88px;
	}

	.note-hero {
		width: min(1120px, calc(100vw - 48px));
		margin: 56px auto 72px;

		img {
			display: block;
			width: 100%;
			height: auto;
		}
	}

	.note-back {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 7px;
		margin: 0 0 22px;
		padding: 0;
		border: 0;
		background: transparent;
		color: var(--color-400);
		font-size: 0.86rem;
		line-height: 1;
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: color 0.22s ease, transform 0.22s ease;

		span {
			font-size: 0.95rem;
			transform: translateY(-1px);
		}

		&:hover {
			transform: translateX(-3px);
			color: #8b6a2b;
			text-decoration: none;
		}
	}

	.note-content {
		max-width: 720px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 0 24px;

		h1 {
			margin: 12px 0 32px;
			font-family: 'Huiwen-mincho', serif !important;
			font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 4.2vw, 4rem);
			font-weight: 400;
			line-height: 1.18;
			color: var(--color-100);
			letter-spacing: 0;
			text-align: left;
		}

		p {
			margin: 0 0 1.35em;
			color: var(--color-200);
			font-size: 1.08rem;
			line-height: 2.05;
		}

		.lead {
			color: #8b6a2b;
			font-family: 'Huiwen-mincho', var(--font-body);
			font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 3vw, 2rem);
			line-height: 1.6;
			margin-bottom: 1.45em;
		}
	}

	.note-meta {
		color: #9b7a35;
		font-family: var(--font-type);
		font-size: 0.82rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.04em;
	}

	.note-reminder {
		margin-top: 44px;
		padding: 22px 0 0 22px;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(184, 138, 55, 0.22);
		border-left: 3px solid rgba(184, 138, 55, 0.7);

		h2 {
			margin-bottom: 12px;
			color: var(--color-100);
			font-size: 1.28rem;
		}

		p {
			margin-bottom: 0;
		}
	}

	@media(max-width: 767px) {
		.note-hero {
			width: calc(100vw - 32px);
			margin-top: 34px;
			margin-bottom: 48px;
		}

		.note-content {
			padding: 0 24px;

			h1 {
				font-size: 2.45rem;
			}

			p {
				font-size: 1rem;
				line-height: 1.95;
			}
		}
	}
</style>
